  "notes": "COMPOUND: {編|へん} (compile) + {集|しゅう} (gather)\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n・{編集|へんしゅう}する (to edit)\n・{編集|へんしゅう}{者|しゃ} (editor)\n・{編集|へんしゅう}{長|ちょう} (editor-in-chief)\n・{編集|へんしゅう}{部|ぶ} (editorial department)\n・{動画|どうが}{編集|へんしゅう} (video editing)\n・{写真|しゃしん}{編集|へんしゅう} (photo editing)\n・{編集|へんしゅう}ソフト (editing software)\n\nCONTEXTS:\n・Publishing: books, magazines\n・Media: video, audio, photography\n・Software: text, code\n\n[Register: Neutral]",
